{"data":[{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:55:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112286585584779768"],"id":"2112286585584779768","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":706,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":6},"text":"SECO-2, spacecraft separation: MMX and the H3 second stage are on an Earth escape hyperbola with C3=9.97 km2/s2","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2112286585584779768"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:59:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112272489095282937"],"id":"2112272489095282937","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3354,"like_count":37,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":6},"text":"Finally on the launch webcast a clearer explanation of the mission profile: the PM is jettisoned into Mars orbit before arrival at Phobos; the EM is jettisoned into Mars orbit prior to RM's Mars orbit departure (but I suspect after Deimos encounter?)","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2112272489095282937"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:50:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112270095804149822"],"id":"2112270095804149822","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":682,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"the ominous build music you hear playing is the leadup to @FamStudies droppin' heat in a new fertility report tomorrow so stay tuned people","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112270095804149822"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112269646258728960"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:48:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112269747941425455"],"id":"2112269747941425455","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":7924,"like_count":175,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":53},"text":"Liftoff of JAXA’s Martian Moons eXploration (MMX) at 4:41 am JST (3:41 pm ET / 1941 UTC). Separation of the spacecraft is expected about an hour and 11 minutes after liftoff. https://t.co/w3ouwtP2z2","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2112269747941425455"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:45:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112268963321421954"],"id":"2112268963321421954","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1933,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112252709713711189","type":"quoted"}],"text":"i am a firm believer all of these \"hubs\" were actually just in the land now under the Persian Gulf\n\nit was a perfect climate at that time!!! https://t.co/b8zDdvJyUY","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112268963321421954"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:43:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112268295596634330"],"id":"2112268295596634330","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6618,"like_count":86,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":16},"text":"LAUNCH at 1941 UTC Oct 19 of MMX from Tanegashima! Go MMX!","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2112268295596634330"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112265974309101570"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:34:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112266046916661288"],"id":"2112266046916661288","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7802,"like_count":67,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":17},"text":"Teams in Japan polled 'go' to proceed with the countdown to launch the H3 rocket. Onboard is the Martian Moons eXploration (MMX) spacecraft, designed to capture and return a sample from the Martian moon, Phobos.\n\nJAXA's English language broadcast: https://t.co/q5rBUke7UO https://t.co/Mt2zfrRX4M","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2112266046916661288"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:51:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112255319136936313"],"id":"2112255319136936313","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1055,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"was asking Claude some suggestions for a report title about a fertility topic and without any wink or a hint of realizing it suggested \"Room to Grow\" which feels suspiciously lebensraum-ey","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112255319136936313"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:12:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112245445766652075"],"id":"2112245445766652075","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3589,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"This week I am at the International Association for the Advancement of Space Safety (IAASS) conference; GCAT will be updated at the weekend when I am back in London.","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2112245445766652075"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:03:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112243153528852779"],"id":"2112243153528852779","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1705,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111882070376980529","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I think where AI-capabilities-optimists are most correct is that AI will accelerate scientific progress and the advance of the knowledge frontier.\n\nI think they overestimate how important that is. https://t.co/6RqDyyw3Pc","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112243153528852779"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:47:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112239223059501413"],"id":"2112239223059501413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1799,"like_count":67,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112238523294126090","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Children's tax payments are the only thing that's relevant! https://t.co/KQf0auOpnt","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112239223059501413"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112239089491517440"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:46:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112239100375998676"],"id":"2112239100375998676","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":854,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Restrictionist legal changes aimed at cracking down on too-easy naturalization in 1906 in fact succeeded at limiting political gaming of naturalization and led to the average naturalizee earning more and assimilating faster. https://t.co/KkT6s08pxr","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112239100375998676"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112235345668407296"]},"author_id":"6374602","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:34:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112235883793400254"],"id":"2112235883793400254","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":2693,"like_count":63,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":10},"text":"The many moods of MMX, from JAXA's imagery archive. https://t.co/3INpO5YfNb","url":"https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2112235883793400254"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:21:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112232575653888317"],"id":"2112232575653888317","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":16650,"like_count":288,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":58},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111501770870698398","type":"quoted"}],"text":"After 2 days in close proximity (less than 5 km, possibly much less), Kosmos-2612 moved away from ICEYE X36 on Oct 18 and is now more than 100 km away, according to US Space Force tracking data https://t.co/2Fkd4g9pyy","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2112232575653888317"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:16:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112231325629579548"],"id":"2112231325629579548","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":3489,"like_count":61,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112214685022052841","type":"quoted"}],"text":"oh it's me https://t.co/7m8vxaUAQ3","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112231325629579548"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T15:25:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112203375202750736"],"id":"2112203375202750736","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2505,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111791555564470652","type":"quoted"}],"text":"The median economist says growth will be ~2% in 2030.\n\nMedian normie says ~5%.\n\nMedian Anthropie says ~17%.\n\nI assume Anthropies have some normie-type biases.\n\nI assume growth might be (Economist*(Anthropie/Normie))= ~7%\n\nBut even that I doubt. https://t.co/MkMMHgfCzF","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112203375202750736"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T14:44:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112193271162188014"],"id":"2112193271162188014","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5221,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112180695481352347","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I think the distribution here is about correct (i.e. the rich may have bigger families), but something seems off-- \n\nFewer than 25% of women will have a 3rd child, yet ~40% of families have 3+ children? That seems off somehow. https://t.co/bHJWzsfzqH","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112193271162188014"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T13:28:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112174090031132982"],"id":"2112174090031132982","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1174,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112052387955577012","type":"quoted"}],"text":"GDP/hours worked is not a very credible measure even setting aside the fact that countries don't measure hours in remotely similar ways https://t.co/KSKS6jyqIX","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112174090031132982"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T13:20:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112171996624674984"],"id":"2112171996624674984","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1846,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112165213202157907","type":"quoted"}],"text":"something very humorous to me about the fact that the AIs are *so* much worse at Stata coding than other environments https://t.co/0ThMz2I97S","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112171996624674984"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T13:12:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112170051780415974"],"id":"2112170051780415974","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":5431,"like_count":86,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111653272968933555","type":"quoted"}],"text":"the most realistic part of Star Wars was infantry being mounted on fast personal hovercraft\n\nfuture infantry assaults will be on such craft. unbound by terrain, easily vaulting obstacles, very fast, no worry about landmines, etc https://t.co/8Idveb15QL","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112170051780415974"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T13:06:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112168525909426391"],"id":"2112168525909426391","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2111,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112165061766590943","type":"quoted"}],"text":"1) A minimum benefit calculated as a % of the median wage of full-time workers in the prior 5 years (maybe 30% of it?)\n2) Plus an additional small benefit calculated based on earnings history\n3) Plus an an additional larger benefit calculated on social security taxes paid by https://t.co/gjUsm1jvHC","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112168525909426391"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:49:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112164340472402358"],"id":"2112164340472402358","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1208,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112161574882582772","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Correct!! https://t.co/x0JA2Eeyly","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112164340472402358"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:49:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112164293990850586"],"id":"2112164293990850586","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1679,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112163473618804866","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Correct.\n\nMost retirees are net takers. https://t.co/tXFcrP7hY4","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112164293990850586"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:48:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112163904671678684"],"id":"2112163904671678684","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":9368,"like_count":138,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111871188381430023","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Correct me if I'm wrong, but if the house has $190,000 equity, you could easily get at least $140,000 out from a HELOC or 2nd mortgage, meaning the home does not have to be sold, but the inheritor could just use the equity to pay the debt. https://t.co/xZm0Cm9qkj","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112163904671678684"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:15:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112155776961945675"],"id":"2112155776961945675","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":16917,"like_count":377,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111966337132294528","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Correct— the system is very poorly designed! https://t.co/kQu1SjBfc9","url":"https: